                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n\nactor User\n\nparticipant Dashboard as Frontend Dashboard\nparticipant Backend\nparticipant Database\nparticipant ESP as ESP8266 Monitoring Node\nparticipant STM as STM32 Control Node\nparticipant Relay\n\n%%=========================\n%% Sensor Monitoring\n%%=========================\n\nloop Periodic Monitoring\n\nESP-&gt;&gt;ESP: readTemperature()\nESP-&gt;&gt;ESP: readHumidity()\nESP-&gt;&gt;ESP: readLight()\n\nESP-&gt;&gt;ESP: buildSensorPayload()\n\nESP-&gt;&gt;Backend: mqtt_publish_sensor(payload)\n\nBackend-&gt;&gt;Backend: validateSensorData()\n\nBackend-&gt;&gt;Database: insertSensorData()\n\nBackend--&gt;&gt;Dashboard: notifyNewSensorData()\n\nend\n\n%%=========================\n%% User Control\n%%=========================\n\nUser-&gt;&gt;Dashboard: Turn ON Fan\n\nDashboard-&gt;&gt;Backend: POST /api/control\n\nBackend-&gt;&gt;STM: sendControlCommand()\n\nSTM-&gt;&gt;STM: parseControlCommand()\n\nSTM-&gt;&gt;Relay: relay_set_state(ON)\n\nRelay--&gt;&gt;STM: Device Activated\n\nSTM--&gt;&gt;Backend: updateDeviceStatus()\n\nBackend--&gt;&gt;Dashboard: Device Status Updated\n\nDashboard--&gt;&gt;User: Fan ON&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KQ51JegBHDG02GvkQq9D-1">
